Package: txt2latex
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, awk
Suggests: texlive
Description: convert flat ASCII text to LaTeX.
 txt2latex converts the input text into LaTeX. 
 .
 If input file FILE is omitted, standard input is used. 
 Result is displayed on standard output. 
 .
 txt2latex is also able to recognize sections, paragraphs,
 lists (itemize, enumerate, description), verbatim blocks as well as
 inline maths and equations.

